GVDataSet Name=HMSForRAS-CWMS-ResSim_RAS
Description=Copy of CMWS NAVD88 network with added junctions and local flows set up for RFC forecast.  Routing data supplied from HEC-RAS models.  Flood zones are the rules from the FIS ResSim model and the conservation/buffer zones rules are from the IRRMBaseline ResSIm model. (GV Data Set for CWMS-ResSim_RAS)


